WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.412
The rotation plan is where
the design becomes concrete.

2
00:00:03.412 --> 00:00:06.413
Each fictional app is at a
different point in its life.

3
00:00:06.413 --> 00:00:10.337
One is due and freshly approved,
so it's renewed in Key Vault.

4
00:00:10.337 --> 00:00:12.551
One was already renewed by the vault,

5
00:00:12.551 --> 00:00:15.575
so the new certificate is
attached beside the old.

6
00:00:15.575 --> 00:00:20.450
One has been verified and has finished
its overlap, so its old certificate goes.

7
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:24.700
And three apps still use secrets,
which are flagged for replacement.

8
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.900
Apply it to the fake, run the full suite,
and five hundred thirteen tests pass.
